{"h":"<p>不想错过我的任何照片吗？关注我的<a href=\"https://civitai.com/collections/5167942\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">帖子收藏</a></p><p>似乎有些人在通过缺失节点安装 LogicUtils 节点时遇到困难。如果是这种情况，只需搜索“LogicUtils”或直接通过 url 安装。<a href=\"https://github.com/aria1th/ComfyUI-LogicUtils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/aria1th/ComfyUI-LogicUtils</a><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1989b35c-9313-447c-bdf7-24da7b3857b5/width=525/1989b35c-9313-447c-bdf7-24da7b3857b5.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>此工作流程允许您根据需要自动在两个强度值之间创建任意数量的步骤，并将它们保存为带有强度标记的单个图像和网格。还可以使用扩展值保存为单个图像和网格。</p><h3>教程：</h3><p>选择LoRA</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/cd53930e-ffb0-43e9-82a3-7e0790eaae18/width=525/cd53930e-ffb0-43e9-82a3-7e0790eaae18.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>定义 LoRA 强度（开始/停止/步骤）</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/53ae49c0-8386-492c-8311-eb29773e8baf/width=525/53ae49c0-8386-492c-8311-eb29773e8baf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>定义分辨率</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/85e19d6b-1996-44d6-82c2-f07a643d53bf/width=525/85e19d6b-1996-44d6-82c2-f07a643d53bf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>定义提示/种子/步骤/采样器/调度器/模型/剪辑/vae</p><p>（注意目前仅支持 1 个调度器和 1 个采样器）</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/afc4c85f-875a-4512-b7bc-9e2a1235c5a7/width=525/afc4c85f-875a-4512-b7bc-9e2a1235c5a7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>选择应保存的内容。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/ebedea8a-645f-4ad6-9194-8d231b27bc8d/width=525/ebedea8a-645f-4ad6-9194-8d231b27bc8d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>存储发生在 /LoRA-Test/[lora_name] 中的输出文件夹中</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bf704416-b31e-44be-881f-34a435a9d828/width=525/bf704416-b31e-44be-881f-34a435a9d828.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>Don't want to miss any of my pictures? Follow my<a href=\"https://civitai.com/collections/5167942\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Post Collection</a></p><p>It seems that some people have difficulties installing the LogicUtils nodes via missing nodes. If this is the case just search for “LogicUtils” or install directly via url.<a href=\"https://github.com/aria1th/ComfyUI-LogicUtils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/aria1th/ComfyUI-LogicUtils</a><br><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1989b35c-9313-447c-bdf7-24da7b3857b5/width=525/1989b35c-9313-447c-bdf7-24da7b3857b5.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>This Workflow allows you to automatically create as many steps between two strength values as you wish and save them as single images and grids with a strength marker. It is also possible to save with extended values, both as a single image and as a grid.</p><h3>Tutorial:</h3><p>Select LoRA</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/cd53930e-ffb0-43e9-82a3-7e0790eaae18/width=525/cd53930e-ffb0-43e9-82a3-7e0790eaae18.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Define LoRA strength (start/stop/step)</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/53ae49c0-8386-492c-8311-eb29773e8baf/width=525/53ae49c0-8386-492c-8311-eb29773e8baf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Define Resolution</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/85e19d6b-1996-44d6-82c2-f07a643d53bf/width=525/85e19d6b-1996-44d6-82c2-f07a643d53bf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Define prompt/seed/step/sampler/scheduler/model/clip/vae</p><p>(ATTENTION at the moment only one scheduler and one sampler is supported)</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/afc4c85f-875a-4512-b7bc-9e2a1235c5a7/width=525/afc4c85f-875a-4512-b7bc-9e2a1235c5a7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Select what should be saved.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/ebedea8a-645f-4ad6-9194-8d231b27bc8d/width=525/ebedea8a-645f-4ad6-9194-8d231b27bc8d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>The storage takes place in your output folder in /LoRA-Test/[lora_name]</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bf704416-b31e-44be-881f-34a435a9d828/width=525/bf704416-b31e-44be-881f-34a435a9d828.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>"}}